# Repo-root ignores. The app has its own .gitignore under onboarding-app/.

# Large presentation/document files that live here for convenience but are not
# part of the app — GitHub rejects pushes near 100MB and a 54MB binary in the
# history slows every clone from then on.
*.pptx
*.docx
!onboarding-app/backend/*.docx
!onboarding-app/Form A T S/*.docx
